(4870408, 707461, 83313, '<td valign="top">To be honest, A floral shot really has to be different to stand out to me. I want to like this, but I''m afraid it just does not stand out to me. It looks like there is also a bit of harsh lighting from flash.</td>', 'To be honest, A floral shot really has to be different to stand out to me. I want to like this, but I''m afraid it just does not stand out to me. It looks like there is also a bit of harsh lighting from flash.', '2008-08-06 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4870417, 707415, 83313, '<td valign="top">So, is this telling me you live near some pyromaniacs? Might have had more impact were it not for the other photographer in the pic. Great smoke clouds, though.</td>', 'So, is this telling me you live near some pyromaniacs? Might have had more impact were it not for the other photographer in the pic. Great smoke clouds, though.', '2008-08-06 14:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
