(4870453, 707469, 83313, '<td valign="top">You definitely captured the look of an impending storm. Maybe a slight bump in colors would give it a little more impact, but it''s good.</td>', 'You definitely captured the look of an impending storm. Maybe a slight bump in colors would give it a little more impact, but it''s good.', '2008-08-06 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
