(4871387, 707375, 56275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I love the plants coming out of the water, and the bridge leads up to the sun. Nicely composed.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I love the plants coming out of the water, and the bridge leads up to the sun. Nicely composed.', '2008-08-06 21:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871389, 706568, 56275, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark to get a good idea of what''s going on.</td>', 'It''s a little dark to get a good idea of what''s going on.', '2008-08-06 21:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871394, 706629, 56275, '<td valign="top">Neat shapes and texture.. I''m just not clear on what''s supposed to be the focal point.</td>', 'Neat shapes and texture.. I''m just not clear on what''s supposed to be the focal point.', '2008-08-06 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871395, 706983, 56275, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. I like the colors, especially the green hitting the dash. I was thinking a cleaner windshield would make it a better shot, but I like the difference between the front windshield and the open side window. Just noticed the green on the door lock. Ties it all together. =)</td>', 'I really like this shot. I like the colors, especially the green hitting the dash. I was thinking a cleaner windshield would make it a better shot, but I like the difference between the front windshield and the open side window. Just noticed the green on the door lock. Ties it all together. =)', '2008-08-06 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871398, 705658, 56275, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little gingerbread town. Cute.</td>', 'Looks like a little gingerbread town. Cute.', '2008-08-06 21:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871400, 705081, 56275, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Love the orange and silhouettes.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Love the orange and silhouettes.', '2008-08-06 21:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871405, 707457, 56275, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Surprised we don''t see a reflection in the bay? Too bad about the width limitation.</td>', 'Nice shot. Surprised we don''t see a reflection in the bay? Too bad about the width limitation.', '2008-08-06 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871406, 707239, 56275, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It conveys a strong mood and really tells a story. Great job with lighting and contrast. The yellow/sepia is a good choice.</td>', 'I love this shot. It conveys a strong mood and really tells a story. Great job with lighting and contrast. The yellow/sepia is a good choice.', '2008-08-06 21:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871408, 707451, 56275, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it feels prematurely cropped at the top, and unnecessarily wide on the sides. I think a vertical crop would have served it well.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it feels prematurely cropped at the top, and unnecessarily wide on the sides. I think a vertical crop would have served it well.', '2008-08-06 21:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871411, 707473, 56275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The colors are great, and the leading lines from the dock and clouds lead your right to that gorgeous horizon. Well done. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The colors are great, and the leading lines from the dock and clouds lead your right to that gorgeous horizon. Well done. 10', '2008-08-06 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871414, 707254, 56275, '<td valign="top">Pretty country side.. Wish I could see more of the foreground. Looks like cows or something? Not sure if brightening would have helped, or if it would have blown out the sky. Also looks like a little bit of haloing around the horizon on the right side. Oversaturated blue maybe?</td>', 'Pretty country side.. Wish I could see more of the foreground. Looks like cows or something? Not sure if brightening would have helped, or if it would have blown out the sky. Also looks like a little bit of haloing around the horizon on the right side. Oversaturated blue maybe?', '2008-08-06 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871415, 706615, 56275, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. You captured the glow really well, and the yellow balloon with the blue sky compliment each other nicely.</td>', 'Excellent capture. You captured the glow really well, and the yellow balloon with the blue sky compliment each other nicely.', '2008-08-06 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871417, 707382, 56275, '<td valign="top">I love the backlighting on this shot. Brings a strong emotion to the shot.</td>', 'I love the backlighting on this shot. Brings a strong emotion to the shot.', '2008-08-06 21:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871423, 704973, 56275, '<td valign="top">My eye isn''t really drawn to anything interesting here. The clouds are nice but it''s missing something. Also not sure what the light blue square-ish area is on top? Was this taken through a car window?</td>', 'My eye isn''t really drawn to anything interesting here. The clouds are nice but it''s missing something. Also not sure what the light blue square-ish area is on top? Was this taken through a car window?', '2008-08-06 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871426, 707178, 56275, '<td valign="top">Very pretty seascape. The uneven horizon is distracting though.. also the sky is a bit noisy. Over-sharpened perhaps?</td>', 'Very pretty seascape. The uneven horizon is distracting though.. also the sky is a bit noisy. Over-sharpened perhaps?', '2008-08-06 21:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871427, 707014, 29777, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2008-08-06 21:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871430, 707162, 56275, '<td valign="top">I really like the building on the right, and the lighting and shadows. The clouds look extremely pixelized to me though. Actually, so do the arches in the windows. I think it might just be over-sharpened?</td>', 'I really like the building on the right, and the lighting and shadows. The clouds look extremely pixelized to me though. Actually, so do the arches in the windows. I think it might just be over-sharpened?', '2008-08-06 21:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871433, 707422, 56275, '<td valign="top">Some neat colors in this shot. Was it the long exposure that made the palm tree red?</td>', 'Some neat colors in this shot. Was it the long exposure that made the palm tree red?', '2008-08-06 21:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871434, 707443, 56275, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. The purple in the sky and water pull the photo together nicely.</td>', 'Pretty shot. The purple in the sky and water pull the photo together nicely.', '2008-08-06 21:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871436, 707407, 56275, '<td valign="top">The b/w shot is a good choice here.. I''m just not sure about the crop.</td>', 'The b/w shot is a good choice here.. I''m just not sure about the crop.', '2008-08-06 21:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871437, 707424, 56275, '<td valign="top">Great colors. The reflection is gorgeous, and the shoreline really adds to the shot.</td>', 'Great colors. The reflection is gorgeous, and the shoreline really adds to the shot.', '2008-08-06 21:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871443, 704807, 56275, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouettes and reflections in this shot.. but it feels oversatured to me. Also, I think you could have cropped more on the right side?</td>', 'I like the silhouettes and reflections in this shot.. but it feels oversatured to me. Also, I think you could have cropped more on the right side?', '2008-08-06 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871445, 705483, 56275, '<td valign="top">This has a very dramatic feel to it. Love the ominous clouds rolling in.</td>', 'This has a very dramatic feel to it. Love the ominous clouds rolling in.', '2008-08-06 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871450, 706060, 56275, '<td valign="top">Pretty night shot. I love the reflection, and the green church is a great focal point. Think the saturation is turned up a tad high though, imo.</td>', 'Pretty night shot. I love the reflection, and the green church is a great focal point. Think the saturation is turned up a tad high though, imo.', '2008-08-06 21:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
