(4871468, 707080, 56275, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a sky! It''s very pretty, but it looks really over-saturated. The blues and oranges are bit much. I do love the boy''s silhouette though!</td>', 'Wow! What a sky! It''s very pretty, but it looks really over-saturated. The blues and oranges are bit much. I do love the boy''s silhouette though!', '2008-08-06 21:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
