(4871478, 705512, 56275, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. You captured the fireworks really well, and the reflection of the town in the water is great. Wish the horizon was straightened out though.</td>', 'Really nice shot. You captured the fireworks really well, and the reflection of the town in the water is great. Wish the horizon was straightened out though.', '2008-08-06 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
