(4871480, 706735, 56275, '<td valign="top">Aww.. What a romantic shot. The details in this photo are nice. The hint of light on the road/fence(?), the curl in her hair, the details of her dress, and his coat. Nice shot.</td>', 'Aww.. What a romantic shot. The details in this photo are nice. The hint of light on the road/fence(?), the curl in her hair, the details of her dress, and his coat. Nice shot.', '2008-08-06 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
