(4871482, 707394, 56275, '<td valign="top">It does portray an evening shot.. but it''s not particularly interesting to me. Maybe an interesting building in the foreground would help? Something that reaches over the horizon line.. or a tree or something? Just my two cents..</td>', 'It does portray an evening shot.. but it''s not particularly interesting to me. Maybe an interesting building in the foreground would help? Something that reaches over the horizon line.. or a tree or something? Just my two cents..', '2008-08-06 21:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
