(4871504, 707370, 56275, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot. The capture of the sun is a neat idea. I feel the tree in the foreground takes away from the main subject though.</td>', 'I do like this shot. The capture of the sun is a neat idea. I feel the tree in the foreground takes away from the main subject though.', '2008-08-06 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
