(4872548, 707177, 92577, '<td valign="top">I like the image as it is.<br/>I can''t help thinking that a lot of the voters on this site would prefer you to have used cropping, saturation and a little fill-light to strengthen it.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'I like the image as it is.I can''t help thinking that a lot of the voters on this site would prefer you to have used cropping, saturation and a little fill-light to strengthen it.Good luck', '2008-08-07 12:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4872555, 706821, 92577, '<td valign="top">strong!<br/>Maybe just a little less road in the foreground</td>', 'strong!Maybe just a little less road in the foreground', '2008-08-07 12:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4872560, 707255, 92577, '<td valign="top">I like it but you could easily loose most of the dark area on the left</td>', 'I like it but you could easily loose most of the dark area on the left', '2008-08-07 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
