(4876151, 705102, 97215, '<td valign="top">Quite possibly one of the best here.  The colors are wonderful and the trees at the skyline further the photo''s beauty.  The trees do seem to unbalance the image, but the unbalance add to the natural appeal and makes it seem all the more life-like.  And I love the people in the water!</td>', 'Quite possibly one of the best here.  The colors are wonderful and the trees at the skyline further the photo''s beauty.  The trees do seem to unbalance the image, but the unbalance add to the natural appeal and makes it seem all the more life-like.  And I love the people in the water!', '2008-08-08 20:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876463, 707131, 33672, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great candid! You gatta love the little details. The tatoos t-shirt etc...</td>', 'Wow! Great candid! You gatta love the little details. The tatoos t-shirt etc...', '2008-08-09 01:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
