(4876736, 706932, 47791, '<td valign="top">This could do with having some of the dark sky and sand cropped out as they make the image a bit too dreary.</td>', 'This could do with having some of the dark sky and sand cropped out as they make the image a bit too dreary.', '2008-08-09 07:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
