(4876846, 706344, 29777, '<td valign="top">there seems to be a lot of noise in this shot. It is too bad the person walking blends in with the building across the street. They amost disappear.</td>', 'there seems to be a lot of noise in this shot. It is too bad the person walking blends in with the building across the street. They amost disappear.', '2008-08-09 09:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876848, 707075, 29777, '<td valign="top">The light is good and the shot fully meets the challenge. This would be better if the subject were more to the left of the frame. This would provide movement to the right. The composition would also improve if the subject were higher or lower in the frame depending on what else is in the shot. Think "rule of thirds." The shot also seems soft overall. This may or may not take away from the impact.</td>', 'The light is good and the shot fully meets the challenge. This would be better if the subject were more to the left of the frame. This would provide movement to the right. The composition would also improve if the subject were higher or lower in the frame depending on what else is in the shot. Think "rule of thirds." The shot also seems soft overall. This may or may not take away from the impact.', '2008-08-09 09:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876851, 706103, 29777, '<td valign="top">The lens flare and haze on the right are distracting.</td>', 'The lens flare and haze on the right are distracting.', '2008-08-09 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876852, 706095, 29777, '<td valign="top">The angle in a nice touch and the background adds to the shot. The cup is not sharp.</td>', 'The angle in a nice touch and the background adds to the shot. The cup is not sharp.', '2008-08-09 10:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876857, 706952, 29777, '<td valign="top">The colors and shadows are great.<br/> <br/>The pole and wires are distracting. Perhaps a closer shot with more perspective that still contains plenty of the excellent sky would have been better.</td>', 'The colors and shadows are great. The pole and wires are distracting. Perhaps a closer shot with more perspective that still contains plenty of the excellent sky would have been better.', '2008-08-09 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876858, 706929, 29777, '<td valign="top">The expression is so honest. Very nice. Would be better if her head was just enough to her right to catch a bit more light in her eyes.</td>', 'The expression is so honest. Very nice. Would be better if her head was just enough to her right to catch a bit more light in her eyes.', '2008-08-09 10:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876861, 706218, 29777, '<td valign="top">The title explains a lot about this capture. This is a nice story captured in one frame.</td>', 'The title explains a lot about this capture. This is a nice story captured in one frame.', '2008-08-09 10:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876863, 706656, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful snapshot moment. I''m sure the lighting was very difficult in this setting. The image may fit the challenge better if it we not quite so bright.</td>', 'This is a wonderful snapshot moment. I''m sure the lighting was very difficult in this setting. The image may fit the challenge better if it we not quite so bright.', '2008-08-09 10:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876866, 706922, 29777, '<td valign="top">great color and light rays. This would make a wonderful promo shot for an oil company that wants to promote offshore drilling.</td>', 'great color and light rays. This would make a wonderful promo shot for an oil company that wants to promote offshore drilling.', '2008-08-09 10:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876870, 706658, 29777, '<td valign="top">great panoramic view and reflections. It seems too bright to remind me of evening. I would score this much higher for an outdoor or scenic shot.</td>', 'great panoramic view and reflections. It seems too bright to remind me of evening. I would score this much higher for an outdoor or scenic shot.', '2008-08-09 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876871, 707438, 29777, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.</td>', 'very cool shot.', '2008-08-09 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876873, 707422, 47791, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2008-08-09 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876875, 705774, 29777, '<td valign="top">wow.</td>', 'wow.', '2008-08-09 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876878, 707313, 29777, '<td valign="top">this is so other-worldly. I love the texture on the large rocks.</td>', 'this is so other-worldly. I love the texture on the large rocks.', '2008-08-09 10:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876881, 707315, 47791, '<td valign="top">A great shot of mount Hood. <br/>It brings back memories of the time I spent in Oregon. <br/>The reflection is spectacular but the rock in the lake upsates the mirror effect. At a higher angle without the rock this photo would look spectacular.</td>', 'A great shot of mount Hood. It brings back memories of the time I spent in Oregon. The reflection is spectacular but the rock in the lake upsates the mirror effect. At a higher angle without the rock this photo would look spectacular.', '2008-08-09 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876886, 707316, 29777, '<td valign="top">If I were a coffee drinker I would be all over this. The lights and reflections are great.<br/> <br/>IMO the main glass should be sharp throughout. The depth of field is too narrow for me.</td>', 'If I were a coffee drinker I would be all over this. The lights and reflections are great. IMO the main glass should be sharp throughout. The depth of field is too narrow for me.', '2008-08-09 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876889, 707371, 29777, '<td valign="top">The concept is wonderful and original. I love the direction of the lighting. IMO two things could improve this shot. A gold filter for the main lighting and less noise.</td>', 'The concept is wonderful and original. I love the direction of the lighting. IMO two things could improve this shot. A gold filter for the main lighting and less noise.', '2008-08-09 10:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876892, 707136, 29777, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot for a warm-hearted promotion of some kind.</td>', 'This would be a great shot for a warm-hearted promotion of some kind.', '2008-08-09 10:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876895, 707180, 29777, '<td valign="top">very nice color and shadow.</td>', 'very nice color and shadow.', '2008-08-09 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876901, 706768, 29777, '<td valign="top">The sky is fantastic. I''m sure you could get a better shot of the horse. The fill flash seems a bit too harsh on the horses'' face. A softer fill light would have been a better choice here.</td>', 'The sky is fantastic. I''m sure you could get a better shot of the horse. The fill flash seems a bit too harsh on the horses'' face. A softer fill light would have been a better choice here.', '2008-08-09 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876902, 707260, 29777, '<td valign="top">cool shot, great concept.</td>', 'cool shot, great concept.', '2008-08-09 10:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876908, 705837, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is such a good setting. IMO the shot would be so much better if you could have moved a bit to your left so the boat''s mast did not interfere with the sun. In this way the sun would be framed by the boat, the mast and the dock.</td>', 'This is such a good setting. IMO the shot would be so much better if you could have moved a bit to your left so the boat''s mast did not interfere with the sun. In this way the sun would be framed by the boat, the mast and the dock.', '2008-08-09 10:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876910, 707076, 29777, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2008-08-09 10:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876917, 707456, 29777, '<td valign="top">The composition is lacking. There is no clear subject or direction other than that of moving to the distance. The signs are distracting. The fact that the road leads in a slightly different direction than the power lines does not help.</td>', 'The composition is lacking. There is no clear subject or direction other than that of moving to the distance. The signs are distracting. The fact that the road leads in a slightly different direction than the power lines does not help.', '2008-08-09 10:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876919, 707461, 29777, '<td valign="top">nice flowers. I would prefer to see them one at a time and with a much softer light.</td>', 'nice flowers. I would prefer to see them one at a time and with a much softer light.', '2008-08-09 10:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876921, 706792, 29777, '<td valign="top">The subject in the foreground is out of focus.</td>', 'The subject in the foreground is out of focus.', '2008-08-09 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876927, 705081, 29777, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the clouds add to this. I really like the bird and sun combo.</td>', 'I''m not sure the clouds add to this. I really like the bird and sun combo.', '2008-08-09 10:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876931, 707286, 29777, '<td valign="top">The concept is very nice. Three things: 1) the glass needs to be perfectly clean. 2) the spec of dirt near the glass is distracting. 3) the surface the glass and bottle are sitting on is distracting. Try shooting this again using a dark gray or matte black surface for the glass and bottle.</td>', 'The concept is very nice. Three things: 1) the glass needs to be perfectly clean. 2) the spec of dirt near the glass is distracting. 3) the surface the glass and bottle are sitting on is distracting. Try shooting this again using a dark gray or matte black surface for the glass and bottle.', '2008-08-09 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876995, 707369, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. The sun, rays and sky are excellent. The light on the curtains and frame is a bit harsh and uneven. The curtains are also cropped in a way that is distracting. I think this should would be better without the curtains. They are too busy for the rest of the image.</td>', 'I like the concept. The sun, rays and sky are excellent. The light on the curtains and frame is a bit harsh and uneven. The curtains are also cropped in a way that is distracting. I think this should would be better without the curtains. They are too busy for the rest of the image.', '2008-08-09 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876997, 706821, 29777, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.</td>', 'very cool shot.', '2008-08-09 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876999, 707469, 29777, '<td valign="top">The silhouette is out of focus.</td>', 'The silhouette is out of focus.', '2008-08-09 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877000, 707255, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the lens flare in this.</td>', 'I like the lens flare in this.', '2008-08-09 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877002, 707385, 29777, '<td valign="top">The clouds are nice but not that interesting. The shot needs something of interest.</td>', 'The clouds are nice but not that interesting. The shot needs something of interest.', '2008-08-09 11:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877004, 706734, 29777, '<td valign="top">great colors.</td>', 'great colors.', '2008-08-09 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877015, 705664, 29777, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2008-08-09 11:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877021, 704604, 29777, '<td valign="top">The shot is busy. IMO everything on the left should be cropped out. Put the tree in the extreme left of the shot and the boy 1/3 of the way in and down. Think "rule of thirds." It is too bad the sky is not more interesting.</td>', 'The shot is busy. IMO everything on the left should be cropped out. Put the tree in the extreme left of the shot and the boy 1/3 of the way in and down. Think "rule of thirds." It is too bad the sky is not more interesting.', '2008-08-09 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877024, 706052, 29777, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2008-08-09 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877084, 707178, 14867, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark, but it like the mood that the darkness provides here.<br/>On the other hand, the leaning horizon is a real issue.</td>', 'It''s very dark, but it like the mood that the darkness provides here.On the other hand, the leaning horizon is a real issue.', '2008-08-09 12:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4877086, 707472, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great sky, good colors...but very poor foreground !</td>', 'Great sky, good colors...but very poor foreground !', '2008-08-09 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
