(4879804, 706403, 96762, '<td valign="top">needs a bit of contrast.  overall its a nice capture.</td>', 'needs a bit of contrast.  overall its a nice capture.', '2008-08-11 04:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879805, 705928, 96762, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2008-08-11 04:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879807, 705483, 96762, '<td valign="top">very Ansel Adams.  nice capture.</td>', 'very Ansel Adams.  nice capture.', '2008-08-11 04:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879809, 707371, 96762, '<td valign="top">there is quite a bit of noise in this image.  While I do like what you were going for, I think it might suffer a little from the crop or lack thereof.  Good Luck and great idea!</td>', 'there is quite a bit of noise in this image.  While I do like what you were going for, I think it might suffer a little from the crop or lack thereof.  Good Luck and great idea!', '2008-08-11 04:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879811, 707134, 96762, '<td valign="top">great capture.  Only thing that sort of bothers me is that the people look very restrained, like they were posing for the shot, stiff.   Other than that, great shot.   good luck</td>', 'great capture.  Only thing that sort of bothers me is that the people look very restrained, like they were posing for the shot, stiff.   Other than that, great shot.   good luck', '2008-08-11 04:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879814, 705697, 96762, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the title of your image.  "Sunset for Two"?  <br/>seems a little on the dark side.  its an interesting shot.  At least it has the element of "Evening" to it, unlike MANY of the images submitted to this challenge.  best of luck</td>', 'Not sure I get the title of your image.  "Sunset for Two"?  seems a little on the dark side.  its an interesting shot.  At least it has the element of "Evening" to it, unlike MANY of the images submitted to this challenge.  best of luck', '2008-08-11 04:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879815, 706489, 96762, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2008-08-11 04:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879816, 707080, 96762, '<td valign="top">the orange is way too saturated.  that would be my only complaint.  seems like you bumped up the saturation levels a bit too much for the overall image which also made the image look flat as well.</td>', 'the orange is way too saturated.  that would be my only complaint.  seems like you bumped up the saturation levels a bit too much for the overall image which also made the image look flat as well.', '2008-08-11 04:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879817, 707136, 96762, '<td valign="top">needs more contrast.  it also seems like you used the shadow/highlight on this.  I could be wrong.  If yo did, I dont think it helped the image.  I would have liked to have seen more shadows to really help pull in the whole "evening" feel.</td>', 'needs more contrast.  it also seems like you used the shadow/highlight on this.  I could be wrong.  If yo did, I dont think it helped the image.  I would have liked to have seen more shadows to really help pull in the whole "evening" feel.', '2008-08-11 04:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879818, 706095, 96762, '<td valign="top">it doesnt seem that anything in the image is in focus or maybe I am just sleepy.  I dont know.  <br/>I will look at this again tomorrow and perhaps I will change my vote but for now, it''s just not doing anything for me.  best of luck to you though.</td>', 'it doesnt seem that anything in the image is in focus or maybe I am just sleepy.  I dont know.  I will look at this again tomorrow and perhaps I will change my vote but for now, it''s just not doing anything for me.  best of luck to you though.', '2008-08-11 04:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879819, 707180, 96762, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest here, when I first looked at the image, it looked like it was two images connected together because of the contrasting colors  I think you should have darkened the ship a bit to help bring the photo together.  It would have been balanced more that way.  Even after looking at it over again, it really does look like two photos spliced together.  Im not saying that it is.  Perhaps the foreground is a tad distracting.  I don''t know.  There is just something about the image that doesnt balance out right for me.  good luck in the challenge! :)</td>', 'I have to be honest here, when I first looked at the image, it looked like it was two images connected together because of the contrasting colors  I think you should have darkened the ship a bit to help bring the photo together.  It would have been balanced more that way.  Even after looking at it over again, it really does look like two photos spliced together.  Im not saying that it is.  Perhaps the foreground is a tad distracting.  I don''t know.  There is just something about the image that doesnt balance out right for me.  good luck in the challenge! :)', '2008-08-11 04:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879820, 706532, 96762, '<td valign="top">image is a bit busy and doesnt really reflect "evening" to me.  nice colors and capture though.  best of luck</td>', 'image is a bit busy and doesnt really reflect "evening" to me.  nice colors and capture though.  best of luck', '2008-08-11 04:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879822, 707461, 96762, '<td valign="top">seems like on camera flash was used for this image.  When I vote in a challenge, the Challenge Topic is what really sways my voting.  So if I am going to be honest here, I have to tell you that this image doesnt really fit in the "Evening" category for me.  The pink in the border really doesnt help the image in my opinion.  The flash seems to have washed out some detail as well.  Sorry if I sound harsh, I am just giving my honest opinion, like I would want someone else to do for me.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'seems like on camera flash was used for this image.  When I vote in a challenge, the Challenge Topic is what really sways my voting.  So if I am going to be honest here, I have to tell you that this image doesnt really fit in the "Evening" category for me.  The pink in the border really doesnt help the image in my opinion.  The flash seems to have washed out some detail as well.  Sorry if I sound harsh, I am just giving my honest opinion, like I would want someone else to do for me.  Best of luck to you.', '2008-08-11 04:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879823, 707435, 96762, '<td valign="top">this image wold have benefited with a little levels and curves adjustment.  nice capture and good luck</td>', 'this image wold have benefited with a little levels and curves adjustment.  nice capture and good luck', '2008-08-11 04:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879825, 707178, 96762, '<td valign="top">i personally do not understand why people add borders to their photos here.  Just not my cup of tea so to speak.  <br/>Nice capture, a little noisy and I think it would have benefited with a curves/level adjustment and also without the border.  best of luck</td>', 'i personally do not understand why people add borders to their photos here.  Just not my cup of tea so to speak.  Nice capture, a little noisy and I think it would have benefited with a curves/level adjustment and also without the border.  best of luck', '2008-08-11 04:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879827, 706442, 96762, '<td valign="top">nice image.  overall though, the blue hue is just too much.  the two people also looked very posed and restrained.  The blue hue on the white shirts  almost looks  like something you would catch under a black light.  best of luck</td>', 'nice image.  overall though, the blue hue is just too much.  the two people also looked very posed and restrained.  The blue hue on the white shirts  almost looks  like something you would catch under a black light.  best of luck', '2008-08-11 04:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879829, 705512, 96762, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I just dont see the point of the border.  I don''t know why people insist on using borders for photos that dont need them.  <br/>overall, its a nice capture though.  best of luck</td>', 'nice shot, I just dont see the point of the border.  I don''t know why people insist on using borders for photos that dont need them.  overall, its a nice capture though.  best of luck', '2008-08-11 04:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879830, 707254, 96762, '<td valign="top">image is a bit on the dark side.</td>', 'image is a bit on the dark side.', '2008-08-11 04:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879831, 707169, 96762, '<td valign="top">image is overexposed.  a curve/level adjustment would have helped the image.</td>', 'image is overexposed.  a curve/level adjustment would have helped the image.', '2008-08-11 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879832, 706218, 96762, '<td valign="top">funny shot.  I personally dont think it will rate very high though.  it has more of a snap shot feel than anything.  at least it has the element of "evening" to it unlike so many that have been submitted.</td>', 'funny shot.  I personally dont think it will rate very high though.  it has more of a snap shot feel than anything.  at least it has the element of "evening" to it unlike so many that have been submitted.', '2008-08-11 04:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879834, 707014, 96762, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s a LOT of red.  The border does nothing for the image, in fact, I feel like it might even take away from the overall shot.  This image would have definitely benefited from a bit of destat on the red.</td>', 'wow, that''s a LOT of red.  The border does nothing for the image, in fact, I feel like it might even take away from the overall shot.  This image would have definitely benefited from a bit of destat on the red.', '2008-08-11 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879835, 707407, 96762, '<td valign="top">im not sure black and white was the best for this image.</td>', 'im not sure black and white was the best for this image.', '2008-08-11 04:20:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4879836, 706735, 96762, '<td valign="top">i have seen this pose in almost every photo like this and I am a little tired of it.  it seems so contrived.  the people look restrained.  its not a bad shot.  there is just nothing appealing about it.  sorry.  best of luck though.</td>', 'i have seen this pose in almost every photo like this and I am a little tired of it.  it seems so contrived.  the people look restrained.  its not a bad shot.  there is just nothing appealing about it.  sorry.  best of luck though.', '2008-08-11 04:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879840, 706568, 96762, '<td valign="top">Like I tell everyone else.  when I vote on a challenge, the challenge Title means everything.   The title was "Evening" and nothing about this shot gives me the feeling of evening.  <br/>On the technical side.  It looks like an on camera flash was used and it washed out a good bit of detail in my opinion.  My overall vote was because of the lack of subject for the challenge title.  sorry.</td>', 'Like I tell everyone else.  when I vote on a challenge, the challenge Title means everything.   The title was "Evening" and nothing about this shot gives me the feeling of evening.  On the technical side.  It looks like an on camera flash was used and it washed out a good bit of detail in my opinion.  My overall vote was because of the lack of subject for the challenge title.  sorry.', '2008-08-11 04:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879841, 707456, 96762, '<td valign="top">would have benefited with a curve/level adjustment.  The white balance is off in my opinion.  Too blue.  This sort of has just a snap shot feel to it.  sorry.   best of luck to you though.</td>', 'would have benefited with a curve/level adjustment.  The white balance is off in my opinion.  Too blue.  This sort of has just a snap shot feel to it.  sorry.   best of luck to you though.', '2008-08-11 04:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879842, 705102, 96762, '<td valign="top">this looks like a snap shot to me.  The border is horrible in my opinion, it does nothing for the image, if anything it hinders the overall shot.   Sorry.</td>', 'this looks like a snap shot to me.  The border is horrible in my opinion, it does nothing for the image, if anything it hinders the overall shot.   Sorry.', '2008-08-11 04:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879845, 707451, 96762, '<td valign="top">I think its a good shot.  It is blown out way too much on the left though.  But that''s not why I am giving a low score.  When I vote on challenges, I really take the Subject of the challenge into high consideration, as everyone should.  <br/>The challenge was "Evening" and I don''t find anything about this shot to be categorized in "evening".  <br/>  Even the title of the shot leads as far away to the challenge as the image itself.   <br/>I think it would have been better for you to submit this image for a different challenge and also work on the levels and curves if you do.   <br/>I am curious to hear why you submitted this particular shot for a "Evening Challenge"</td>', 'I think its a good shot.  It is blown out way too much on the left though.  But that''s not why I am giving a low score.  When I vote on challenges, I really take the Subject of the challenge into high consideration, as everyone should.  The challenge was "Evening" and I don''t find anything about this shot to be categorized in "evening".    Even the title of the shot leads as far away to the challenge as the image itself.   I think it would have been better for you to submit this image for a different challenge and also work on the levels and curves if you do.   I am curious to hear why you submitted this particular shot for a "Evening Challenge"', '2008-08-11 04:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879849, 707019, 96762, '<td valign="top">I get where you were trying to go with this image but it just didnt work out, in my opinion.  good luck to you.</td>', 'I get where you were trying to go with this image but it just didnt work out, in my opinion.  good luck to you.', '2008-08-11 04:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879855, 707434, 96762, '<td valign="top">Technically it''s a good capture.  On my screen though, it looks like there was a lot of cloning and healing used, mostly on the right side of the image.   I can see brighter spots and lines where there shouldnt be any.  My monitor is calibrated so it picks up a lot of things.  <br/>Okay, now onto the scoring side.  I have said this about 20 times already during this challenge and I will say it again here.   The title of the challenge is "Evening".  What does this have to do with Evening in your opinion because I don''t get it.  It doesnt look like Evening</td>', 'Technically it''s a good capture.  On my screen though, it looks like there was a lot of cloning and healing used, mostly on the right side of the image.   I can see brighter spots and lines where there shouldnt be any.  My monitor is calibrated so it picks up a lot of things.  Okay, now onto the scoring side.  I have said this about 20 times already during this challenge and I will say it again here.   The title of the challenge is "Evening".  What does this have to do with Evening in your opinion because I don''t get it.  It doesnt look like Evening', '2008-08-11 04:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879856, 706656, 96762, '<td valign="top">i personally cant believe that you submitted this image for a challenge.</td>', 'i personally cant believe that you submitted this image for a challenge.', '2008-08-11 04:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879857, 707382, 96762, '<td valign="top">my favorite photo for this challenge and my only 10.  good luck, this deserves to place in the top 3</td>', 'my favorite photo for this challenge and my only 10.  good luck, this deserves to place in the top 3', '2008-08-11 04:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879858, 706486, 96762, '<td valign="top">technically, i like the photo.  I am really torn on this one though, because when I vote for challenges, I really take into HIGH consideration the Title of the challenge (which everyone should) and in this case the title is "Evening".  <br/>  I think it''s a great image.   I think it will do well in the challenge.  Its nice to see something besides lakes and sunsets (no offense to those who submitted those)  <br/>Best of luck to you.</td>', 'technically, i like the photo.  I am really torn on this one though, because when I vote for challenges, I really take into HIGH consideration the Title of the challenge (which everyone should) and in this case the title is "Evening".    I think it''s a great image.   I think it will do well in the challenge.  Its nice to see something besides lakes and sunsets (no offense to those who submitted those)  Best of luck to you.', '2008-08-11 04:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4879859, 706821, 96762, '<td valign="top">nice lines, color and overall balance.  I think you captured a great shot.  maybe a tad bit of contrast is needed in the streets.  great job and good luck</td>', 'nice lines, color and overall balance.  I think you captured a great shot.  maybe a tad bit of contrast is needed in the streets.  great job and good luck', '2008-08-11 04:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
