(4880374, 707338, 91314, '<td valign="top">Add contrast to the photo would help highlight this photo. The color is a bit dull but the photo has some potential.</td>', 'Add contrast to the photo would help highlight this photo. The color is a bit dull but the photo has some potential.', '2008-08-11 11:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880379, 706910, 91314, '<td valign="top">The glare of the sun washes out the photo.  The color of the horses would have made this picture standout much more.</td>', 'The glare of the sun washes out the photo.  The color of the horses would have made this picture standout much more.', '2008-08-11 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880382, 705102, 91314, '<td valign="top">The high contrast of the photo has made it look blurry.  The borders you chose for this photo has taken away the effect of the photo.</td>', 'The high contrast of the photo has made it look blurry.  The borders you chose for this photo has taken away the effect of the photo.', '2008-08-11 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880388, 707180, 91314, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo but the reflection of the sunlight on the water is a bit distracting.  The orange sky gives the photo a nice feature but because of the distraction of the glare it has taken the lime light away from the sky. Which in my opinion is the main feature in the photo.  Making the sky crisp and toning down that glare the photo would have been much better.</td>', 'Interesting photo but the reflection of the sunlight on the water is a bit distracting.  The orange sky gives the photo a nice feature but because of the distraction of the glare it has taken the lime light away from the sky. Which in my opinion is the main feature in the photo.  Making the sky crisp and toning down that glare the photo would have been much better.', '2008-08-11 11:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880393, 706095, 91314, '<td valign="top">A micro lens to really focus on the coffe cup may have been better to use.  It would help blur the background more, highlight and bring the coffee cup in focus.</td>', 'A micro lens to really focus on the coffe cup may have been better to use.  It would help blur the background more, highlight and bring the coffee cup in focus.', '2008-08-11 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880396, 706668, 91314, '<td valign="top">I see what your trying to do but its not quite there.  If you had less of the foreground and maybe focus a bit on it to give some depthness to the photo this may have been better.</td>', 'I see what your trying to do but its not quite there.  If you had less of the foreground and maybe focus a bit on it to give some depthness to the photo this may have been better.', '2008-08-11 11:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880400, 707315, 91314, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo.  Nice and crisp and it almost makes me feel I am there.  Beautifully done.  I predict this photo will make it to the front page.</td>', 'Fabulous photo.  Nice and crisp and it almost makes me feel I am there.  Beautifully done.  I predict this photo will make it to the front page.', '2008-08-11 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880406, 706052, 91314, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the photo but not sure what your geting at with the title unless your talking about the eclipes.</td>', 'Nice color in the photo but not sure what your geting at with the title unless your talking about the eclipes.', '2008-08-11 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4880413, 707014, 91314, '<td valign="top">Making this photo crisp looking would have really put this on the top of the list for me. Probably adding some contrast would have should the levels of color better, would have giving that feeling of a surreal sunset.</td>', 'Making this photo crisp looking would have really put this on the top of the list for me. Probably adding some contrast would have should the levels of color better, would have giving that feeling of a surreal sunset.', '2008-08-11 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
