(4884006, 707249, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pleasing. A lot of interesting elements here, however the eye is properly drawn to the main subject of the people. If this were advanced editing, I would suggest selectively sharpening the boys and water a little more, perhaps also intensifying their silhouettes. Such scenes are often harder under basic rules.</td>', 'Pleasing. A lot of interesting elements here, however the eye is properly drawn to the main subject of the people. If this were advanced editing, I would suggest selectively sharpening the boys and water a little more, perhaps also intensifying their silhouettes. Such scenes are often harder under basic rules.', '2008-08-12 23:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
