(4884075, 707459, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find this interesting, as my outtake for this challenge has a similar treatment of a similar foreground. I''m curious to see how yours does in voting and comments.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=710251" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/710251.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/710251.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/710251.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I think the horizon line is a bit too centered in the frame. I find it visually divides it into two separate images.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-13 00:16:23.</i></td>', 'I find this interesting, as my outtake for this challenge has a similar treatment of a similar foreground. I''m curious to see how yours does in voting and comments.  I think the horizon line is a bit too centered in the frame. I find it visually divides it into two separate images.', '2008-08-12 23:19:03.000000', '2008-08-13 01:16:23.000000', 1),
(4884078, 706344, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light is playing off of the buildings. Nicely composed as well. The image as a whole seems a little soft, though, with some visible noise in the sky.</td>', 'I like the way the light is playing off of the buildings. Nicely composed as well. The image as a whole seems a little soft, though, with some visible noise in the sky.', '2008-08-12 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884082, 705685, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ah, the old "wideangle with swoopy clouds" entry. Nice golden glow to this and the comp leads my eye nicely. Too bad you couldn''t get rid of those modern cars.</td>', 'Ah, the old "wideangle with swoopy clouds" entry. Nice golden glow to this and the comp leads my eye nicely. Too bad you couldn''t get rid of those modern cars.', '2008-08-12 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4884083, 705837, 86322, '<td valign="top">Great composition, love the sunset, very sentimental. love it!</td>', 'Great composition, love the sunset, very sentimental. love it!', '2008-08-12 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
