(4885320, 707149, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  You may not know this, but you were the reason I joined this website more than two years ago.  I''d been following your photography at your photo blog, and you posted about winning a couple of ribbons at some site, so I checked it out.  Thanks for the tip. ;-)</td>', 'Lovely image.  You may not know this, but you were the reason I joined this website more than two years ago.  I''d been following your photography at your photo blog, and you posted about winning a couple of ribbons at some site, so I checked it out.  Thanks for the tip. ;-)', '2008-08-13 09:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
