(4890828, 707451, 75849, '<td valign="top">Firstly, thanks to all those who commented on my photo - am relatively new here (in terms of posting, I guess) and my entry for this challenge was a) a bit of a last minute decision and b) I wanted a different take on the theme. I did expect a low score, but maybe not this low. Anyway, you live and learn. <br/>So, blackbox and yospiff got the idea behind the image - and mstone to answer your question, I wanted to give the word a different interpretation - something not so obvious. I guess it got interpreted as being too abstract.</td>', 'Firstly, thanks to all those who commented on my photo - am relatively new here (in terms of posting, I guess) and my entry for this challenge was a) a bit of a last minute decision and b) I wanted a different take on the theme. I did expect a low score, but maybe not this low. Anyway, you live and learn. So, blackbox and yospiff got the idea behind the image - and mstone to answer your question, I wanted to give the word a different interpretation - something not so obvious. I guess it got interpreted as being too abstract.', '2008-08-15 19:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
